WEBVTT

01:42.320 --> 01:43.900
- I've cut them.
- Okay.

01:47.020 --> 01:47.860
‪Okay, I got it.

01:51.660 --> 01:52.840
I'll get it for you.

01:59.540 --> 02:00.540
You are back!

02:03.880 --> 02:06.140
She looks upset. Shall we check?

02:06.180 --> 02:07.580
- I will go check on her.
- Sure.

02:17.380 --> 02:18.260
Yingtao.

02:21.700 --> 02:22.780
What happened?

02:25.360 --> 02:26.600
Is this the outfit?

02:26.840 --> 02:29.000
- Hm.
- Let me see.

02:31.320 --> 02:32.900
It's actually really nice.

02:34.340 --> 02:35.980
Why are there two sets?

02:37.000 --> 02:38.780
One set belongs to Qin Yeyun.

02:40.360 --> 02:42.080
Please help me deliver it to her.

02:42.900 --> 02:44.900
She's too lazy to take it by herself.

02:45.500 --> 02:47.840
Qin Family Mart didn't open today.

02:47.880 --> 02:50.520
Maybe your Uncle Qin
took Yun to visit relatives.

02:51.060 --> 02:53.300
Visit relatives? How old is she?

02:53.340 --> 02:55.800
Yun's family situation
is different from ours.

02:55.840 --> 02:57.840
When her dad takes her to visit relatives,

02:57.880 --> 02:59.580
it's because he wants her

02:59.620 --> 03:01.060
to have their support later on.

03:01.640 --> 03:03.500
She has our support. That's not enough?

03:03.540 --> 03:04.540
What else does she want?

03:11.080 --> 03:11.940
What's wrong?

03:13.100 --> 03:14.820
Did you two bicker?

03:16.860 --> 03:18.480
I didn't do anything.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.680
Nothing I'd known.

03:19.720 --> 03:21.040
She treated me like that.

03:21.080 --> 03:23.240
What else does she want from me?

03:23.280 --> 03:24.880
When you give her the clothes,
tell her this:

03:24.920 --> 03:26.020
If she doesn't want me

03:26.060 --> 03:27.180
as friends, then fine.

03:27.220 --> 03:28.120
We shall part ways.

03:28.160 --> 03:29.440
We're done. Forever.

03:30.960 --> 03:31.840
Cai.

03:32.380 --> 03:33.220
What's wrong?

03:34.280 --> 03:35.300
I'm cooking.

03:35.960 --> 03:37.560
You still talk exactly

03:37.600 --> 03:39.060
like you did as a kid.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.660
Back then,

03:40.700 --> 03:42.240
every time you lost a fight to Yun,

03:42.280 --> 03:43.940
you'd come home with these angry talks.

03:43.980 --> 03:44.980
They are not angry talks!

03:47.300 --> 03:48.340
Fine.

03:48.380 --> 03:49.300
- What's wrong?
- Come here.

03:51.780 --> 03:52.760
What happened?

03:54.160 --> 03:55.540
Manager Cai just called.

03:56.040 --> 03:57.800
Qin had trouble.

03:57.840 --> 03:58.780
He's in hospital now.

03:58.820 --> 03:59.840
Is it bad?

03:59.880 --> 04:01.120
I don't know.

04:01.160 --> 04:02.700
We'd better visit him.

04:03.520 --> 04:04.420
Hospital?

04:05.300 --> 04:06.180
Qin Yeyun.

04:10.980 --> 04:13.440
I don't need to be hospitalized at all,

04:14.160 --> 04:15.000
really!

04:15.040 --> 04:15.940
You…

04:16.440 --> 04:18.240
Can you guys help me talk to Yun?

04:18.279 --> 04:20.740
Tell her not to listen to

04:20.779 --> 04:21.959
the doctor's nonsense.

04:22.540 --> 04:24.260
There's no way I need to stay here.

04:24.300 --> 04:26.140
Just let me go.

04:26.640 --> 04:27.480
Brother Qin.

04:27.520 --> 04:29.100
You really need to listen.

04:29.720 --> 04:31.260
If you truly care about Yun,

04:31.300 --> 04:32.700
you've got to get proper treatment.

04:32.740 --> 04:34.780
We just ran into Yunyun outside.

04:34.820 --> 04:36.000
The kid said

04:36.040 --> 04:37.480
she'll only be okay if you get better.

04:38.020 --> 04:39.760
You are making life harder for her.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.860
Right.

04:40.900 --> 04:42.540
You have such a wonderful daughter.

04:43.080 --> 04:44.400
How can you refuse proper treatment?

04:44.900 --> 04:46.260
Do you know your stubbornness

04:46.300 --> 04:47.620
is putting a lot pressure on Yun?

04:49.180 --> 04:50.620
Just now, someone said

04:51.160 --> 04:52.720
I'm lucky

04:52.760 --> 04:54.040
to have such a good daughter,

04:54.700 --> 04:55.980
only 17

04:56.640 --> 04:58.140
but taking responsibilities like an adult.

04:58.180 --> 05:00.400
But I hate hearing that.

05:01.020 --> 05:02.360
Ever since she was little,

05:03.320 --> 05:04.980
she's never had a real childhood.

05:06.240 --> 05:07.620
After her mom passed away,

05:07.660 --> 05:09.620
she's been carrying this family,

05:09.660 --> 05:10.760
all by herself.

05:12.120 --> 05:13.260
And me?

05:13.300 --> 05:14.960
I can't do a damn thing for her.

05:15.660 --> 05:16.680
- Cai,
- I am here.

05:17.860 --> 05:20.480
I just want to save up some money

05:20.520 --> 05:23.040
to make her future easier.

05:23.080 --> 05:25.680
I can't waste it all on the hospital.

05:26.580 --> 05:29.580
Besides, this leg of mine
is never gonna get better anyway.

05:29.620 --> 05:30.580
Brother Qin.

05:30.620 --> 05:32.120
Don't you worry about the costs.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.480
It's a work-related injury.

05:33.520 --> 05:35.300
All your hospital expenses
will be covered by the factory.

05:36.860 --> 05:38.560
- Don't sit up!
- Lie down!

05:38.600 --> 05:39.560
What are you going to do?

05:40.060 --> 05:41.100
Cai.

05:41.140 --> 05:43.620
But I already received

05:43.660 --> 05:45.900
a one-time compensation
for this injury back then.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.080
It can still be covered?

05:48.880 --> 05:50.400
Of course.

05:50.440 --> 05:52.000
New policy you don't know about yet.

05:52.040 --> 05:54.480
If you don't believe me, ask Lin or Yu.
There is a new…new policy.

05:54.520 --> 05:56.180
- Right. There is one.
- Yes, new policy.

06:00.580 --> 06:01.820
This is an old injury,

06:02.560 --> 06:05.640
from over a decade ago.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.720
A relapse of an old injury…

06:08.480 --> 06:09.820
Absolutely no problem.

06:09.860 --> 06:11.320
Listen, I'm telling you straight up.

06:11.360 --> 06:12.760
Let's get proper treatment, alright?

06:12.800 --> 06:14.040
Exactly!

06:14.080 --> 06:15.180
- Take good care.
- Right.

06:15.220 --> 06:16.280
- Get well.
- Don't worry.

06:16.820 --> 06:18.040
- Have some fruit.
- Eat.

06:18.080 --> 06:19.900
- Let him rest early.
- Okay.

06:50.400 --> 06:51.280
Give me.

06:52.020 --> 06:53.260
You don't know how to pack.

07:10.740 --> 07:11.640
Then you…Ouch!

07:21.400 --> 07:22.500
Don't pick up with hands!

07:22.540 --> 07:23.580
You'll get hurt!

07:31.880 --> 07:32.920
- I'm sorry.
- I'm sorry.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.180
Let me clean it up.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.500
I didn't go today.

07:45.540 --> 07:46.800
You're not mad at me, right?

07:48.140 --> 07:50.200
How could I be mad at you?

07:50.240 --> 07:52.480
I knew you must've had something going on.

07:52.520 --> 07:53.680
That's why you didn't make it.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.880
Surely you won't

07:56.420 --> 07:58.060
stay mad at me over this.

07:58.100 --> 07:58.940
In fact,

07:59.440 --> 08:00.940
not only am I not upset with you,

08:00.980 --> 08:02.620
I'm planning to personally deliver

08:02.660 --> 08:04.020
your clothes to you myself.

08:05.960 --> 08:06.800
Ling Yingtao.

08:07.300 --> 08:09.440
Honestly, you don't need
to do this for me.

08:09.940 --> 08:11.280
You didn't do anything wrong.

08:12.460 --> 08:14.620
These past few days,
I'm the one who made you unhappy.

08:14.660 --> 08:16.980
I really should be apologizing to you.

08:17.020 --> 08:18.260
But right now,

08:18.760 --> 08:20.760
what I want to say most is thank you.

08:22.020 --> 08:23.600
Thank me for what?

08:27.580 --> 08:28.840
Honestly…

08:28.880 --> 08:30.640
I was…

08:31.580 --> 08:32.940
a little upset today,

08:32.980 --> 08:33.820
but just a tiny bit.

08:34.580 --> 08:35.780
Like, barely even there.

08:35.820 --> 08:37.220
Then I should thank you too.

08:38.480 --> 08:39.440
Thank you for what?

08:40.179 --> 08:41.539
For bringing you clothes,

08:42.080 --> 08:44.960
or for coming back with you to pack up?

08:49.740 --> 08:50.600
Yingtao,

08:50.640 --> 08:51.780
promise me one thing.

08:52.780 --> 08:54.700
Go ahead. I will definitely promise you.

08:56.320 --> 08:58.720
Don't go to school alone tomorrow.

08:58.760 --> 08:59.700
Go with the others.

09:01.800 --> 09:03.260
I…

09:03.300 --> 09:06.500
Yu Qiao likes you

09:06.540 --> 09:08.020
is just a misunderstanding.

09:11.300 --> 09:13.260
That compatibility test
between you and him

09:13.300 --> 09:15.240
was sent by Yu Jin.

09:15.280 --> 09:17.740
He wants you to be his sister-in-law.

09:18.460 --> 09:19.740
Yu Jin sent it?

09:22.680 --> 09:24.440
I told you it was just a joke.

09:24.480 --> 09:25.660
How could it possibly be real?

09:25.700 --> 09:27.900
Now that you know
Yu Jin was the one who sent it,

09:27.940 --> 09:30.100
you're still mad at me? That's cold.

09:31.340 --> 09:33.900
I only found out last night too.

09:34.720 --> 09:37.060
Yu Jin came to the shop
to buy bubble rolls

09:37.100 --> 09:38.200
and told me himself.

09:38.780 --> 09:40.380
Yu Jin, that little rascal!

09:40.420 --> 09:42.340
Playing matchmaking at his age?

09:42.380 --> 09:43.440
And Yu Qiao's no better,

09:43.480 --> 09:45.280
can't even keep track of his own phone.

09:45.820 --> 09:47.200
I'll talk to him once I get back.

09:49.820 --> 09:51.320
Here's the plan.

09:51.360 --> 09:53.080
Just pretend you don't know it for now.

09:59.080 --> 10:00.920
Alright, got it.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.360
I'll play dumb for now.

10:03.640 --> 10:05.820
But seriously,
what a mess they two have made!

10:05.860 --> 10:07.020
I went through all that for nothing.

10:07.680 --> 10:08.880
Right, it's their fault.

10:12.620 --> 10:14.060
- I'll get a bag.
- Okay.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.140
Yun.

10:18.220 --> 10:19.580
Listen.

10:19.620 --> 10:21.720
We've already covered
all your dad's hospital expenses.

10:21.760 --> 10:22.880
I checked with the doctor,

10:22.920 --> 10:25.400
and he said it should last
until his discharge.

10:25.440 --> 10:27.360
Once the reimbursement comes through,

10:27.400 --> 10:28.740
you can pay us back then. No rush.

10:29.240 --> 10:30.180
Uncle Cai.

10:30.220 --> 10:32.640
It has been over ten years.
The factory still reimburse it?

10:32.680 --> 10:34.100
Uncle Cai is the manager.

10:34.140 --> 10:35.280
Would a manager lie to you?

10:35.980 --> 10:38.660
From now on, don't worry about money.

10:38.700 --> 10:39.880
It's all taken care of.

10:40.480 --> 10:42.160
Uncle Cai, how much did you pay?

10:42.200 --> 10:43.700
I'll withdraw the money for you.

10:43.740 --> 10:45.000
Don't! Come on.

10:45.500 --> 10:47.140
We all know how your dad is.

10:47.180 --> 10:48.880
That money he saved
must be a fixed deposit.

10:48.920 --> 10:50.220
Wouldn't it be a total waste

10:50.260 --> 10:51.420
- to withdraw it now?
- Yes.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.020
All that interest is gone.

10:53.660 --> 10:56.380
Thank you, uncles and aunties.

10:56.420 --> 10:57.420
You're welcome.

11:02.080 --> 11:04.960
Yun, you're still in school,

11:05.000 --> 11:06.820
and 11th grade is tough enough as it is.

11:06.860 --> 11:09.880
I am only doing some chores, sell skewers.

11:09.920 --> 11:12.260
Now that it's getting cold,

11:12.300 --> 11:13.840
fried food doesn't sell well.

11:13.880 --> 11:14.800
Tell you what.

11:14.840 --> 11:16.700
I'll take care of your dad during the day

11:16.740 --> 11:18.100
so you can focus on studying.

11:18.140 --> 11:20.380
Then after school,

11:20.420 --> 11:21.780
we'll switch shifts.

11:21.820 --> 11:22.840
No, Aunt Shuangyan.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.000
This is way too much trouble for you.

11:24.880 --> 11:25.880
No, listen.

11:25.920 --> 11:27.280
Your Uncle Cai and the others

11:27.320 --> 11:29.060
are actually paying me for this,

11:29.100 --> 11:31.020
with a rate higher than
regular hospital caretaker.

11:31.620 --> 11:32.780
Plus, all these expenses

11:32.820 --> 11:33.960
are reimbursable.

11:34.620 --> 11:36.880
Yun, it is some good arrangment.

11:36.920 --> 11:37.740
You see.

11:37.780 --> 11:38.620
In this way,

11:38.660 --> 11:41.280
your dad gets proper care.
You can focus on school without worries.

11:41.320 --> 11:43.280
Your Aunt Shuangyan

11:43.320 --> 11:44.600
will get paid.

11:44.640 --> 11:45.880
A triple win.

11:45.920 --> 11:46.920
Exactly.

11:46.960 --> 11:48.460
Don't tell me

11:48.500 --> 11:50.140
you'd deny Aunt a chance
to earn this money?

11:50.180 --> 11:51.180
Of course not, Aunt.

11:51.920 --> 11:53.420
Then thank you so much, Aunt Shuangyan.

11:55.240 --> 11:57.520
Thank you for helping me get paid for

11:58.020 --> 11:59.020
being a caretaker.

12:03.580 --> 12:05.200
Our cheerleading uniforms are nice.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.160
I'll swing by your class

12:06.200 --> 12:07.340
to give it to you tomorrow.

12:07.380 --> 12:09.680
I doubt your definition of good-looking.

12:10.220 --> 12:11.280
Really nice.

12:11.780 --> 12:14.240
The whole squad voted on them.

12:16.060 --> 12:18.900
Look at you two, glued together again.

12:18.940 --> 12:20.060
Like eels in a hot wok,

12:20.840 --> 12:22.160
the more you sizzle, the closer you get.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.340
Yingtao.

12:24.380 --> 12:26.020
Now that you've made up with Qin Yeyun,

12:26.060 --> 12:28.080
does this mean
you'll still hang out with us?

12:28.120 --> 12:30.140
Right. Keep your fights
between yourselves.

12:30.180 --> 12:31.480
We are innocent but got impacted.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.700
We're not picking sides.

12:33.500 --> 12:34.880
You've been bickering since childhood,

12:34.920 --> 12:36.200
and have we ever meddled?

12:36.240 --> 12:37.820
No matter how bad it gets now,

12:37.860 --> 12:39.020
don't freeze us out.

12:39.060 --> 12:40.840
Who even wants to play with you guys?

12:40.880 --> 12:42.300
This is because…

12:44.220 --> 12:45.180
Because what?

12:46.680 --> 12:47.640
Because you're ugly.

12:50.400 --> 12:52.540
Just because I'm ugly,
you stop hanging out with us?

12:54.700 --> 12:56.740
Such a major issue,
you didn't even bother to tell us?

12:57.280 --> 12:58.920
Qin Yeyun, that's unforgivable.

12:59.880 --> 13:01.120
I'm not happy about this either.

13:01.620 --> 13:03.320
- Me, too.
- Me, too.

13:05.020 --> 13:07.540
You guys are really pushing your luck now.

13:09.380 --> 13:10.640
Go home and sleep it off.

13:11.920 --> 13:13.740
Don't walk us any further. Head back now.

13:13.780 --> 13:15.020
We'll wait until you're inside.

13:16.120 --> 13:17.460
Speak up if anything comes up.

13:27.560 --> 13:28.800
From now on,

13:29.300 --> 13:31.060
we've gotta be more perceptive.

13:31.100 --> 13:32.000
Why?

13:32.600 --> 13:35.100
Don't you know
that's just how Qin Yeyun is?

13:35.140 --> 13:37.240
The tougher things get,
the more she bottles it up.

13:37.280 --> 13:38.680
If she won't tell us,

13:38.720 --> 13:40.060
we'll have to notice it ourselves.

13:50.540 --> 13:53.820
DEVOTED TO LEARNING, PURSUING TRUTH;
CULTIVATING VIRTUE, ACHIEVING SINCERITY.

13:59.720 --> 14:01.760
- Nice.
- Careful.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.500
Listen up, team!

14:07.480 --> 14:09.540
The Sports Day starts tomorrow,

14:09.580 --> 14:11.940
and I have full confidence
in your performance.

14:11.980 --> 14:13.060
For now,

14:13.100 --> 14:15.420
the only thing you need to do
is go home, rest well,

14:15.460 --> 14:17.200
and save your energy.

14:17.760 --> 14:19.520
I'm looking forward to
your amazing show tomorrow!

14:19.560 --> 14:20.560
Dismissed!

14:20.600 --> 14:21.820
- Okay!
- Okay!

14:28.320 --> 14:29.380
Yu Qiao.

14:30.180 --> 14:31.420
Yu Qiao!

14:32.200 --> 14:33.380
- I have to go.
- Yingtao.

14:33.420 --> 14:34.260
‪Yes?

14:35.360 --> 14:36.260
Hey, watch it!

14:36.460 --> 14:37.100
‪What?

14:37.140 --> 14:38.080
I have a big news

14:38.580 --> 14:39.600
for you.

14:39.640 --> 14:40.580
Good news.

14:40.620 --> 14:42.360
What is the good news?

14:43.980 --> 14:45.880
WARM WELCOME FOR THE VISIT
FROM QINGBEI UNIVERSITY

14:45.920 --> 14:49.000
Teachers from Qingbei University are here
to meet students in the math competition.

14:49.040 --> 14:50.320
So Jiang Qiaoxi will definitely

14:50.360 --> 14:51.660
be at school tomorrow.

14:51.700 --> 14:53.920
Jiang Qiaoxi sure knows
how to pick his moment.

14:54.580 --> 14:56.840
Yingtao, he'll get to see
your amazing performance.

14:57.520 --> 14:58.360
‪Well.

15:08.160 --> 15:10.720
Thank you, Ms. Juan.

15:10.760 --> 15:14.160
After a long day at work, you still make
me stuffed lotus roots and jujube buns.

15:14.200 --> 15:15.380
I truly appreciate it.

15:15.420 --> 15:16.540
Enough.

15:17.040 --> 15:19.220
Your classmates are truly something.

15:19.260 --> 15:22.080
They only fancy stuffed lotus roots
and jujube buns?

15:25.120 --> 15:28.160
Yes. It is my top recommendation.

15:28.660 --> 15:30.120
You can try other things after this.

15:33.160 --> 15:34.560
Add some sugar.

15:35.380 --> 15:37.200
Enough. Too much.

15:37.240 --> 15:39.120
- Not enough.
- No. Too sweet.

15:39.160 --> 15:40.400
Jiang Qiaoxi doesn't like…

15:48.020 --> 15:49.500
I knew it!

15:49.540 --> 15:50.960
You could've just told me upfront

15:51.000 --> 15:52.340
it was for Qiaoxi.

15:52.380 --> 15:53.760
Worry that I'd disagree?

15:54.240 --> 15:55.080
‪Well.

15:57.420 --> 15:58.260
‪I mean…

15:58.820 --> 15:59.780
You…

16:06.520 --> 16:08.020
Is someone blushing?

16:09.060 --> 16:10.040
Yun.

16:10.860 --> 16:12.740
- Uncle Jiang.
- I was just about to go see your dad.

16:12.780 --> 16:13.800
Thank you.

16:14.400 --> 16:16.460
Just got back
from a business trip a few days ago.

16:16.500 --> 16:18.140
I heard that
your dad was in hospital again.

16:18.180 --> 16:19.320
So I came here to check on him.

16:19.820 --> 16:21.680
Thank you, uncle. Sorry for the trouble.

16:21.720 --> 16:22.860
Don't worry about it.

16:22.900 --> 16:24.760
How's your dad now?

16:25.260 --> 16:26.480
If there's any difficulty,

16:26.520 --> 16:27.860
you must tell Uncle.

16:27.900 --> 16:29.240
No need to hold back, understand?

16:29.740 --> 16:31.080
Recently, he's been…

16:31.680 --> 16:32.760
okay.

16:35.540 --> 16:36.640
Yun.

16:38.980 --> 16:40.000
Take it.

16:40.040 --> 16:41.320
Really, Uncle, I can't.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.860
- Come on. Take it.
- I can't accept it.

16:42.900 --> 16:43.760
Take it!

16:47.360 --> 16:48.320
Uncle Jiang.

16:49.520 --> 16:51.360
My dad's medical expenses this time.

16:51.400 --> 16:53.140
Can it be covered by the factory?

16:59.640 --> 17:00.600
Yun.

17:00.640 --> 17:03.380
Your dad's injury
happened over a decade ago.

17:03.880 --> 17:05.940
The situation is a bit complicated.

17:05.980 --> 17:07.240
It depends on his condition now.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.940
So it won't be reimbursed.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.619
Don't worry too much.

17:14.660 --> 17:16.599
We will figure something out.

17:16.640 --> 17:17.800
We'll help your family

17:17.839 --> 17:18.900
get through this.

17:20.280 --> 17:21.119
Girl!

17:21.859 --> 17:22.839
Girl.

17:23.960 --> 17:24.900
What's wrong, uncle?

17:24.940 --> 17:25.839
your dad…

17:25.880 --> 17:26.920
he's been in the bathroom

17:26.960 --> 17:28.079
for too long.

17:28.620 --> 17:29.780
I don't know what's wrong.

17:31.740 --> 17:32.960
No matter how hard I knock,

17:33.000 --> 17:34.040
he won't answer.

17:34.540 --> 17:35.780
Dad!

17:35.820 --> 17:38.000
Dad! Open the door! Dad!

17:40.560 --> 17:42.440
What are you doing here?

17:43.140 --> 17:44.180
Go back.

17:44.680 --> 17:45.860
I…

17:45.900 --> 17:47.060
I'll be out in a moment.

17:47.560 --> 17:48.860
I'll be out soon.

17:51.180 --> 17:52.080
I'll find someone to open the door.

17:52.960 --> 17:53.920
Girl, don't go.

17:53.960 --> 17:54.800
Just stay here

17:54.840 --> 17:55.860
while I go find someone.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.800
Dad, open the door.

18:02.760 --> 18:03.820
Yun, I…

18:03.860 --> 18:05.960
Uncle, you should go back today.

18:06.500 --> 18:08.100
I don't think my dad
want to see you today.

18:13.900 --> 18:15.520
Nurse!

19:13.880 --> 19:18.060
MEDICAL CENTER

19:35.780 --> 19:39.700
OPEN

20:01.000 --> 20:02.600
University costs:

20:02.640 --> 20:07.240
Art or Science,
2000 to 3000 yuan per year.

20:07.280 --> 20:10.180
Music and Fine Arts, 5000 yuan per year.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.340
Living expenses:

20:12.380 --> 20:14.040
2000 yuan per month.

20:14.080 --> 20:16.360
80000 yuan total for four years.

20:17.040 --> 20:20.780
At least 150000 yuan
is required for university.

20:21.480 --> 20:24.420
Dowry and Car, 300000 yuan.

20:24.460 --> 20:25.760
Housing, 500000 yuan.

20:25.800 --> 20:27.480
Must be in the East Development Zone.

20:27.520 --> 20:30.660
Good potential and favorable Feng Shui.

20:31.780 --> 20:33.240
Yun mentioned today

20:33.780 --> 20:35.780
that the mart could stock up on

20:35.820 --> 20:38.240
Cardcaptor Sakura cards.

20:38.740 --> 20:40.560
Tons of her classmates are obsessed.

20:45.920 --> 20:48.940
For her tenth birthday wish,

20:49.440 --> 20:51.840
Yun wants to have a pomegranate tree
of her very own.

20:53.140 --> 20:54.180
Here we are.

20:58.020 --> 20:58.960
Yun.

20:59.000 --> 20:59.900
Come here.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.220
Share more with your friends.

21:02.260 --> 21:03.820
Uncle's got plenty here.

21:03.860 --> 21:04.860
Thanks.

21:04.900 --> 21:06.360
I'll grab two more for you.

21:07.320 --> 21:08.400
- Is it good?
- Yes.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.520
It's sweet.

21:11.080 --> 21:14.140
For her thirteenth birthday wish,

21:14.880 --> 21:17.820
Yun dreams of performing onstage
with her favorite actress.

21:18.820 --> 21:20.420
So I've asked the lady from the community

21:20.460 --> 21:21.920
to organize a special event,

21:21.960 --> 21:23.180
for her to dance and shine.

21:23.220 --> 21:24.100
Yun.

21:24.140 --> 21:26.160
That lady was all in smiles

21:26.720 --> 21:28.820
but never approved the venue.

21:30.580 --> 21:33.080
Got Yun a celebrity album instead.

21:33.120 --> 21:35.560
Hope she likes it.

21:57.840 --> 21:59.940
- Try it.
- Let's do makeup.

22:20.040 --> 22:21.000
Qin Yeyun.

22:21.500 --> 22:22.780
Why did you sleep here?

22:24.860 --> 22:25.940
Get up!

22:25.980 --> 22:27.720
We need to change and do makeup.

22:30.540 --> 22:33.320
Did you stay up all night
taking care of Uncle?

22:35.460 --> 22:37.560
I didn't sleep much last night.

22:47.280 --> 22:48.220
I'm fine.

22:48.260 --> 22:49.620
Enough. It's okay.

22:52.500 --> 22:53.860
Can you do it?

22:54.360 --> 22:55.420
Yes.

23:12.580 --> 23:15.040
After meeting the teachers
from Qingbei today, I'll take you

23:15.080 --> 23:16.500
straight back to training camp.

23:17.680 --> 23:18.780
No lingering on campus.

23:19.280 --> 23:20.920
Winter camp is about to start,

23:20.960 --> 23:22.120
and we can't afford delays.

23:26.860 --> 23:28.060
Understood?

23:31.040 --> 23:31.880
Yes.

23:35.260 --> 23:37.300
When we get to the school,

23:37.840 --> 23:38.820
I'll go in with you.

23:40.160 --> 23:42.720
Let me handle this alone.

23:46.660 --> 23:48.140
The meeting doesn't require

23:48.180 --> 23:49.180
parents to come.

23:49.220 --> 23:51.680
Can't I even
have a quick word with Ms. He?

23:55.720 --> 23:57.120
It is Sports Day today.

23:57.160 --> 24:00.020
Your classmates are probably
having way too much fun.

24:00.700 --> 24:01.840
I'm worried

24:02.980 --> 24:04.700
you'll get just as carried away.

24:13.920 --> 24:15.660
- Quickly!
- Quickly!

24:15.700 --> 24:17.820
- What's the hurry?
- Gonna sneak some unflattering shots.

24:17.860 --> 24:19.540
Qin Yeyun used to be a cheerleader too.

24:19.580 --> 24:22.180
The uniforms are practically the same.
Would that makes any difference?

24:26.960 --> 24:28.140
Ling Yingtao.

24:29.080 --> 24:30.300
Damn it!

24:30.340 --> 24:31.620
Damn it!

24:32.920 --> 24:34.300
It just hit me today

24:34.980 --> 24:36.660
Yingtao and I are of different genders.

24:38.500 --> 24:40.140
Yu Qiao. Cai Fangyuan.

24:40.180 --> 24:41.340
What are you doing here?

24:41.380 --> 24:42.400
Called to assemble.

24:49.180 --> 24:50.200
Lin Qile?

24:51.440 --> 24:52.640
Bet you didn't see that coming.

24:52.680 --> 24:54.060
it was Lin Qile!

24:54.100 --> 24:55.480
Of course I could've guessed.

24:56.500 --> 24:57.660
Lin Qile has

24:58.160 --> 24:59.800
always been this radiant in my eyes.

25:01.800 --> 25:04.180
Monitor, you know, people will talk

25:04.220 --> 25:05.820
Don't say it anymore.

25:07.100 --> 25:08.760
What? I mean it.

25:08.800 --> 25:09.920
I'm telling the truth.

25:09.960 --> 25:10.980
SPORTS DAY
LET YOUTH BLOOM WITH VITALITY

25:11.020 --> 25:12.140
Don't look around.

25:12.180 --> 25:14.520
Jiang Qiaoxi is probably
in the principal's office.

25:14.560 --> 25:15.480
Alright,

25:15.520 --> 25:17.980
let's run through one final rehearsal
before hitting the stage.

25:18.020 --> 25:19.440
Keep your energy up.

25:19.480 --> 25:20.360
Remember,

25:20.400 --> 25:21.640
you're all radiant.

25:22.200 --> 25:24.000
After the performance,

25:24.040 --> 25:25.360
don't rush to change.

25:25.400 --> 25:27.480
We're heading to the principal's office

25:27.520 --> 25:29.480
for a group photo
with the Qingbei delegation.

25:30.960 --> 25:32.800
- Come.
- He can't come to you,

25:32.840 --> 25:34.080
but you can always go to him.

25:34.120 --> 25:35.620
And yes, in this outfit.

26:06.360 --> 26:07.400
Are you okay?

26:08.440 --> 26:09.880
Are you okay, Qin Yeyun?

26:09.920 --> 26:11.060
Did you get hurt from the fall?

26:11.100 --> 26:13.260
- Let her take a moment to recover first.
- Did you get hurt?

26:13.300 --> 26:14.340
Don't stand up immediately.

26:14.380 --> 26:15.580
Qin Yeyun.

26:16.360 --> 26:17.860
Why the mistake?

26:19.620 --> 26:20.680
Coach,

26:21.260 --> 26:23.320
I mixed up the moves.

26:24.240 --> 26:25.100
Won't happen again.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.780
Sure.

26:26.820 --> 26:27.880
Have a rest.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.800
Take her to sit there.

26:29.740 --> 26:31.860
The rest of you,
take a quick break where you are.

26:31.900 --> 26:32.740
Take your time.

26:32.780 --> 26:34.240
We'll run through it again shortly

26:36.280 --> 26:37.120
- Okay?
- Take a rest.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.960
- Could it be low blood sugar?
- Qin Yeyun.

26:39.000 --> 26:41.480
Your didn't sleep all night.
You sure you can handle this?

26:49.020 --> 26:50.460
Your didn't sleep all night?

26:51.040 --> 26:51.900
What happened?

26:53.200 --> 26:54.100
Coach,

26:54.740 --> 26:56.980
I'm just a bit nervous.
I couldn't sleep last night.

26:57.480 --> 26:58.980
But just now was totally accidental.

26:59.020 --> 27:00.160
I'm fine, really.

27:00.200 --> 27:01.900
Performance is secondary.

27:01.940 --> 27:02.940
Your safety comes first.

27:02.980 --> 27:04.700
If something like that happened again,

27:04.740 --> 27:06.600
you stumble forward
when you should fall back…

27:06.640 --> 27:08.080
What if you get seriously hurt?

27:10.800 --> 27:12.620
Coach, I…

27:12.660 --> 27:13.580
Safety first.

27:15.800 --> 27:16.800
Qin Yeyun.

27:16.840 --> 27:18.900
there's no way you're going on stage
today as you are now.

27:20.300 --> 27:22.560
Coach.

27:24.020 --> 27:25.600
I know this is my fault

27:25.640 --> 27:27.040
and I should take responsibility.

27:27.840 --> 27:29.200
I'll sit this one out.

27:30.320 --> 27:32.640
But the other three in our lifting group

27:32.680 --> 27:34.120
shouldn't suffer for my mistake.

27:34.160 --> 27:36.340
A trio lift isn't realistic.

27:36.380 --> 27:38.020
Could they maybe adjust the choreography?

27:40.720 --> 27:42.200
Coach,

27:42.240 --> 27:43.920
we've trained so hard for this,

27:43.960 --> 27:45.820
pulling us out last minute

27:45.860 --> 27:47.080
would waste everything.

27:48.060 --> 27:49.280
With your group missing a member,

27:49.320 --> 27:51.040
the coordination will be completely off.

27:52.180 --> 27:53.080
It's okay.

27:53.740 --> 27:55.720
It's better if your entire team
sits this one out.

27:56.220 --> 27:58.660
The remaining members
will reorganize the formation.

27:59.160 --> 28:00.740
The show must go on smoothly.

28:01.720 --> 28:03.780
Don't drag the whole team down

28:04.280 --> 28:05.640
or dampen morale.

28:10.460 --> 28:11.440
Let's do as Xiaoman suggested.

28:11.980 --> 28:13.260
Everyone, give it your all.

28:13.300 --> 28:14.180
Alright,

28:14.220 --> 28:15.320
class, gather up.

28:17.000 --> 28:18.640
Hurry up!

28:19.460 --> 28:21.280
Come on. Quickly.

28:21.320 --> 28:22.740
- It's okay.
- The first formation.

28:28.340 --> 28:29.460
You stand in front.

28:29.500 --> 28:30.480
It's okay.

28:30.980 --> 28:32.980
Come here, you fill in the gap.

28:33.020 --> 28:33.960
Here.

28:35.120 --> 28:36.220
I fetch my bag.

28:39.760 --> 28:40.760
You come over here.

28:42.180 --> 28:43.380
Back there.

28:43.920 --> 28:45.320
- Here.
- It's okay. I can take them.

28:46.800 --> 28:47.680
Good.

28:47.720 --> 28:49.180
The third formation.

29:06.580 --> 29:07.680
I'm sorry.

29:09.940 --> 29:12.480
Qin Yeyun, do you really think
an apology fixes this?

29:13.140 --> 29:14.560
We trained for months,

29:14.600 --> 29:15.700
and now because of you,

29:16.200 --> 29:18.140
we don't even get to step onstage.

29:18.640 --> 29:19.680
How is that fair?

29:21.460 --> 29:23.240
Wu Shuang, I know you're furious,

29:23.740 --> 29:25.860
but Qin Yeyun didn't mess up on purpose.

29:25.900 --> 29:27.880
She's been pushing herself…

29:30.580 --> 29:31.600
to the limit lately.

29:32.100 --> 29:33.160
She hates this more than anyone.

29:33.820 --> 29:34.960
Lin Qile.

29:36.220 --> 29:38.300
why are you still defending Qin Yeyun?

29:38.340 --> 29:41.460
You've fought so hard to go from stumbling
over your own feet to where you are now.

29:41.960 --> 29:43.840
Don't you know how hard that was?

29:44.380 --> 29:45.760
And now, because of her,

29:45.800 --> 29:48.040
you've lost your shot at performing too.

29:48.080 --> 29:49.420
How can you just not even care?

29:49.460 --> 29:51.160
Why take her side?

29:52.460 --> 29:54.720
Between Qin Yeyun and the performance,

29:54.760 --> 29:56.220
I'd choose her, of course.

30:18.640 --> 30:21.120
Sorry, I didn't mean to sound cliquish.

30:25.420 --> 30:27.380
I just panicked and spoke too fast.

30:27.420 --> 30:28.500
I know

30:28.540 --> 30:30.740
how devastated you are about us
missing the show.

30:31.780 --> 30:33.160
What hurts isn't

30:33.200 --> 30:35.120
missing the show,

30:35.740 --> 30:36.960
it's that…

30:37.940 --> 30:40.220
no one's ever said things like this to me.

30:43.000 --> 30:43.980
Wu Shuang.

30:44.540 --> 30:46.580
If you're going to
be upset over Cen Xiaoman,

30:46.620 --> 30:48.140
you might as well just be mad at me.

30:48.760 --> 30:50.380
The truth is, you two…

30:52.060 --> 30:52.900
What's it?

30:54.260 --> 30:55.400
That we were never

30:55.960 --> 30:57.200
real friends, is it?

30:58.720 --> 31:00.460
I didn't mean that.

31:02.460 --> 31:04.880
Honestly, I've always known.

31:06.380 --> 31:07.620
When Cen Xiaoman and I

31:08.120 --> 31:09.380
walk together,

31:10.120 --> 31:12.060
if my shoelaces come undone

31:12.100 --> 31:13.680
and I stop,

31:13.720 --> 31:15.280
she'd never wait.

31:15.320 --> 31:17.200
She keeps me around

31:17.240 --> 31:19.900
just to show off

31:19.940 --> 31:22.420
how popular she is.

31:23.360 --> 31:24.980
And me,

31:25.680 --> 31:28.380
I stuck with her

31:28.420 --> 31:30.080
to be part of the cool clique.

31:30.780 --> 31:33.060
You've got it all figured out,

31:33.100 --> 31:34.700
so why the long face?

31:34.740 --> 31:37.160
If I were her,

31:37.200 --> 31:39.300
I wouldn't sacrifice my friend

31:39.340 --> 31:40.580
just because I don't want

31:40.620 --> 31:43.180
some girl I hate to go onstage.

31:43.220 --> 31:44.800
I won't ignore her feeling.

31:46.360 --> 31:47.780
That's way

31:47.820 --> 31:49.600
you should be feeling sorry for her.

31:50.180 --> 31:52.040
You were the true friend here.

31:52.740 --> 31:55.100
If she couldn't see that,

31:55.600 --> 31:57.160
it's her loss.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.320
Let her drown in regret, right?

32:08.620 --> 32:09.660
Thanks.

32:17.380 --> 32:18.480
Actually…

32:19.140 --> 32:20.580
there might still be a way.

32:21.260 --> 32:22.340
Maybe…

32:22.380 --> 32:23.880
we can salvage our chance to perform.

32:26.840 --> 32:28.080
Listen up, everyone.

32:28.120 --> 32:30.200
Remember the new formation.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.320
Don't mix it up with the old one.

32:31.360 --> 32:33.440
- Coach, wait, please.
- Stay calm and do as usual.

32:33.480 --> 32:34.320
Coach,

32:34.360 --> 32:36.060
Changing the formation now
isn't a good idea.

32:36.980 --> 32:39.300
These moves may look easy,

32:39.340 --> 32:41.080
but if even one person slips up,

32:41.120 --> 32:42.940
- the whole thing falls apart.
- Wu Shuang.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.160
Coach, we just nailed the rehearsal.

32:45.700 --> 32:47.860
Coach, about the lift, we've drilled it

32:47.900 --> 32:49.920
countless times with the new lineup.

32:49.960 --> 32:51.100
Zero room for error, I promise.

32:51.140 --> 32:52.860
- Trust us on this.
- Wu Shuang.

32:52.900 --> 32:54.900
You're throwing this together last minute?
Are you sure?

32:55.480 --> 32:58.320
Coach, even at our worst,

32:58.360 --> 33:01.180
we'd only mess up the final move.

33:01.220 --> 33:02.460
But now with one group missing…

33:02.500 --> 33:04.680
- You can't make absolute decisions.
- Everyone…

33:04.720 --> 33:06.460
You need to
take responsibility for your safety.

33:06.500 --> 33:07.980
We've been rehearsing for so long.

33:08.020 --> 33:09.300
If you suddenly jump in now,

33:09.340 --> 33:10.740
what if someone else gets hurt?

33:10.780 --> 33:12.000
Alright.

33:16.700 --> 33:17.840
All four of you,

33:18.780 --> 33:19.840
fall back in line.

33:21.940 --> 33:23.460
- Thank you, Coach.
- Thank you, Coach.

33:23.500 --> 33:24.740
Thank you, Coach.

33:28.540 --> 33:31.540
Listen, team, after decades of coaching,

33:31.580 --> 33:34.000
do you really think I don't understand?

33:35.240 --> 33:36.560
Today's performance,

33:37.400 --> 33:39.280
however it goes,

33:39.320 --> 33:41.220
it will be forgotten
by the audience tomorrow.

33:41.740 --> 33:43.540
Because it doesn't matter to them.

33:44.040 --> 33:46.660
But for you, this matters.

33:47.660 --> 33:49.160
So give it everything.

33:49.200 --> 33:50.640
Leave no regrets.

33:50.680 --> 33:52.060
That will be perfect for you.

33:53.120 --> 33:54.200
Understood?

33:54.240 --> 33:56.340
- Yes.
- Alright team,

33:57.180 --> 33:58.520
let's hype ourselves up!

34:00.660 --> 34:01.840
On three,

34:01.880 --> 34:03.640
three, two, one.

34:03.680 --> 34:04.980
Go team!

34:12.199 --> 34:13.300
Here,

34:13.340 --> 34:14.420
take this bracelet back.

34:14.460 --> 34:15.760
I don't need it anymore.

34:18.280 --> 34:19.679
Plenty would kill for this

34:19.719 --> 34:21.120
if you don't want it.

34:21.820 --> 34:23.020
Don't regret it later.

34:26.480 --> 34:28.940
I know Qiaoxi will com back today.

34:28.980 --> 34:30.520
I made sure we're here to visit you.

34:31.020 --> 34:32.560
You've been working so hard, Ms. He.

34:32.600 --> 34:33.880
Thank you for saying that.

34:33.920 --> 34:36.300
Teaching exceptional students
like Jiang Qiaoxi

34:36.340 --> 34:38.199
is our reward as teachers.

34:38.900 --> 34:39.920
Now, over here.

34:45.260 --> 34:46.440
Go for it!

34:51.159 --> 34:52.020
SOARING YOUTH, UNSTOPPABLE ENERGY

34:52.060 --> 34:53.300
Go!

34:53.980 --> 34:55.820
Nice!

35:22.480 --> 35:23.420
Sir,

35:25.160 --> 35:26.320
any chance for restroom?

35:26.940 --> 35:27.980
Sure.

35:40.220 --> 35:43.080
Go!

35:45.460 --> 35:47.640
CLASS 12, YEAR 11

35:47.680 --> 35:48.880
CLASS 13, YEAR 11

36:02.740 --> 36:04.200
Xiaoman!

36:04.240 --> 36:05.600
Lin Qile!

36:25.460 --> 36:29.400
Xiaoman!

36:30.080 --> 36:31.540
Lin Qile!

37:55.760 --> 37:57.820
Qiaoxi, sit here.

37:57.860 --> 37:58.960
Scoot over a bit.

38:00.700 --> 38:01.760
Scoot over.

38:15.580 --> 38:16.580
Lin Qile!

39:16.120 --> 39:17.240
Quit slouching.

39:17.280 --> 39:20.040
Chin up, shoulders back.
Today you're the stunning one, so own it.

39:21.600 --> 39:23.240
I am a knockout every single day, okay?

39:23.840 --> 39:25.020
Come here.

39:35.720 --> 39:36.680
Auntie Liang.

39:37.180 --> 39:38.280
Xiaoman.

39:38.320 --> 39:39.940
This is our school's cheer squad.

39:39.980 --> 39:40.820
- Go.
- Let's go.

39:40.860 --> 39:42.040
These kids have been training for months.

39:48.420 --> 39:50.720
That was Jiang Qiaoxi's mom, Auntie Liang.

39:50.760 --> 39:53.000
Isn't she stunning? So elegance.

39:53.040 --> 39:55.560
Xiaoman, you and Qiaoxi's mom
are that close?

39:55.600 --> 39:57.280
You are this tight?

39:58.760 --> 40:01.420
- Lin Qile, you and Jiang Qiaoxi
- Let them wait here.

40:01.460 --> 40:03.520
- were classmates in Qunshan.
- They're in meeting now.

40:03.560 --> 40:06.320
You should know his mom.

40:08.840 --> 40:10.400
Sort of.

40:10.440 --> 40:11.640
We talked.

40:33.040 --> 40:35.500
Jiang Qiaoxi stares right at you.

40:36.060 --> 40:38.620
I'm good-looking.
Who else should he be staring at?

40:39.400 --> 40:40.700
Got the guts to say it louder?

40:49.980 --> 40:51.460
Alright, students,

40:51.500 --> 40:52.820
head inside for the group photo.

40:52.860 --> 40:54.440
Come on, big smiles.

41:03.420 --> 41:04.360
Be happy. Smile.

41:12.480 --> 41:13.480
Over here, please.

41:14.240 --> 41:15.340
This way.

41:18.560 --> 41:20.040
Qiaoxi, come here.

41:20.080 --> 41:21.100
Here.

41:21.140 --> 41:22.020
- Principle.
- Here.

41:22.060 --> 41:23.300
- I'll block others.
- In the middle.

41:23.340 --> 41:24.180
That's fine.

41:24.220 --> 41:26.040
- Next to the teachers.
- I'll find a place.

41:26.080 --> 41:26.780
- Being shy?
- Come.

41:26.820 --> 41:28.180
- Please, Sir. You in the middle.
- Okay.

41:28.680 --> 41:30.340
Everyone, get tight.

41:31.540 --> 41:33.260
First row, down on your haunches
so we can see the second row.

41:35.560 --> 41:36.540
- Sure.
- Okay.

41:38.660 --> 41:39.800
Lin Qile,

41:39.840 --> 41:40.820
move to the left.

41:42.800 --> 41:43.680
You stepped on me.

41:44.580 --> 41:45.460
Sorry.

41:46.060 --> 41:49.000
Everyone, tuck your shirts.

41:49.040 --> 41:51.000
Smooth your collars.

41:51.680 --> 41:53.140
Teachers, smile.

41:53.180 --> 41:54.060
Be happy.

41:54.100 --> 41:55.080
What are you looking at?

41:56.500 --> 41:58.400
- I didn't look at you.
- You did.

41:58.440 --> 41:59.420
I felt it.

42:00.460 --> 42:01.660
I didn't.

42:01.700 --> 42:04.120
Okay, smile.

42:04.160 --> 42:06.160
Three, two, one.

42:12.660 --> 42:13.640
Hi.

42:18.160 --> 42:20.040
Qiaoxi, once winter camp wraps up,

42:20.080 --> 42:21.520
you should pay a visit to Qingbei.

42:22.940 --> 42:24.280
- Quick.
- What?

42:25.000 --> 42:26.720
- Quickly.
- Look how worked up you're getting!

42:26.760 --> 42:27.640
Jiang Qiaoxi.

42:27.680 --> 42:29.980
I kept your study materials
organized for you this whole time.

42:30.020 --> 42:30.860
Let me get change.

42:30.900 --> 42:32.200
- I'll bring them to you later.
- Sure.

42:33.360 --> 42:35.080
- Sir, I'll head back first then.
- Auntie Liang.

42:35.120 --> 42:36.200
- Let me grab Qiaoxi's stuff.
- Okay.

42:36.240 --> 42:37.140
- Thank you, Xiaoman.
- Sure.

42:37.180 --> 42:38.340
- We'll meet at Qingbei University.
- Not at all.

42:38.380 --> 42:39.220
Sure.

42:39.260 --> 42:40.420
Principal, I'll take my leave now.

42:41.680 --> 42:42.780
He's so outstanding.

42:42.820 --> 42:44.240
- This way.
- Let's go.

42:54.400 --> 42:56.460
JIALIN NO. 1 EXPERIMENTAL HIGH SCHOOL

43:01.980 --> 43:03.220
Now what?

43:03.720 --> 43:05.100
We met finally.

43:05.140 --> 43:07.600
But the jujube buns and
stuffed lotus roots…

43:09.940 --> 43:11.500
Also a lot more stuff

43:12.280 --> 43:13.200
I wanted to say to him.

43:13.700 --> 43:14.860
Jiang Qiaoxi.

43:16.980 --> 43:18.000
Auntie Liang.

43:18.040 --> 43:19.140
Xiaoman.

43:19.180 --> 43:21.420
All the materials I've been
collecting for you these days.

43:21.460 --> 43:22.300
Thanks.

43:25.020 --> 43:26.020
Let's go then.

43:26.060 --> 43:27.120
Goodbye.

43:27.160 --> 43:28.220
- Bye.
- Bye-Bye.

43:29.600 --> 43:31.800
There might still be another way.

43:34.840 --> 43:35.840
What's it?

45:56.560 --> 45:58.660
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
